\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Jesus, if we aright confess
\par Our heartfelt poverty,
\par We own the conscious want of grace
\par Itself a gift from Thee;
\par And who our poverty retain,
\par More gifts we shall receive,
\par Mltiplied grace and blessings gain,
\par And all a God can give.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Our scanty stock as soon as known.
\par Our insufficiency
\par For feeding famished souls we own,
\par And bring it Lord, to Thee;
\par Our want received into Thy hand
\par Shall rich abundance prove,
\par Answer the multitude's demand,
\par And fill them with Thy love.
\par                          Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

